1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,816
Snowflakes falling,

2
00:00:01,816 --> 00:00:03,065
soft and slow!

3
00:00:03,315 --> 00:00:04,841
Twirling, swirling,

4
00:00:04,841 --> 00:00:05,950
down they go!

5
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,123
Snowflakes falling,

6
00:00:08,123 --> 00:00:09,570
soft and slow!

7
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,599
Twirling, swirling,

8
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:12,893
down they go!

9
00:00:13,193 --> 00:00:13,843
Look up!

10
00:00:13,843 --> 00:00:14,907
Big snowflakes!

11
00:00:14,907 --> 00:00:16,443
How many can you count?

12
00:00:18,443 --> 00:00:21,136
Five! Five little snowflakes!

13
00:00:22,986 --> 00:00:24,384
I want to catch one,

14
00:00:24,384 --> 00:00:26,390
and keep it for ever and ever!

15
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,870
Ooh! Hold very still, Pip.

16
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:30,980
Shh!

17
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,781
It landed on my nose!

18
00:00:35,781 --> 00:00:37,315
Hee hee, it tickles!

19
00:00:37,865 --> 00:00:39,456
Don't move, Pip!

20
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,795
Don't sneeze!

21
00:00:42,645 --> 00:00:43,245
Drip!

22
00:00:43,545 --> 00:00:45,988
Hey! Where did my snowflake go?

23
00:00:46,238 --> 00:00:47,622
Can you see it?

24
00:00:49,622 --> 00:00:50,351
Hee hee!

25
00:00:50,351 --> 00:00:52,404
It's a little drop of water,

26
00:00:52,404 --> 00:00:54,192
on the tip of your nose!

27
00:00:56,042 --> 00:00:57,336
Quack, quack!

28
00:00:57,336 --> 00:00:59,196
Hello, snow friends!

29
00:00:59,746 --> 00:01:02,784
Dotty! My snowflake turned into water!

30
00:01:03,034 --> 00:01:04,611
Why did it melt?

31
00:01:06,611 --> 00:01:08,713
Your nose is warm, Pip!

32
00:01:08,713 --> 00:01:11,784
When cold snow gets warm, it melts.

33
00:01:12,034 --> 00:01:13,303
Drip!

34
00:01:15,153 --> 00:01:16,559
Let's sing and count!

35
00:01:16,559 --> 00:01:18,961
Wiggle your fingers like falling snow!

36
00:01:19,761 --> 00:01:21,438
Five little snowflakes,

37
00:01:21,438 --> 00:01:22,857
dancing in the sky.

38
00:01:23,157 --> 00:01:26,251
One fell on Pip's warm nose.

39
00:01:26,501 --> 00:01:28,489
Drip! Bye bye!

40
00:01:28,889 --> 00:01:31,370
How many snowflakes are left?

41
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:32,966
Count with me!

42
00:01:34,966 --> 00:01:37,447
Four! Four little snowflakes!

43
00:01:40,597 --> 00:01:42,680
Four little snowflakes,

44
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,443
dancing in the sky.

45
00:01:44,743 --> 00:01:46,834
One fell on Lulu's nose.

46
00:01:46,834 --> 00:01:47,454
Drip!

47
00:01:47,704 --> 00:01:48,858
Bye bye!

48
00:01:49,158 --> 00:01:49,758
Drip!

49
00:01:50,058 --> 00:01:51,558
Oh! How many now?

50
00:01:51,558 --> 00:01:53,357
Hold up your fingers!

51
00:01:55,357 --> 00:01:56,819
Three!

52
00:01:58,669 --> 00:02:00,690
Three little snowflakes,

53
00:02:00,690 --> 00:02:02,337
dancing in the sky.

54
00:02:02,637 --> 00:02:04,671
One fell on Dotty's beak.

55
00:02:04,671 --> 00:02:05,252
Drip!

56
00:02:05,502 --> 00:02:06,656
Bye bye!

57
00:02:06,956 --> 00:02:09,098
Quack! A cold beak kiss!

58
00:02:09,098 --> 00:02:10,764
How many are left?

59
00:02:12,764 --> 00:02:13,747
Two!

60
00:02:15,597 --> 00:02:17,592
Two little snowflakes,

61
00:02:17,592 --> 00:02:19,347
dancing in the sky.

62
00:02:19,647 --> 00:02:22,109
One fell on my warm tummy.

63
00:02:22,359 --> 00:02:23,724
Drip! Bye bye!

64
00:02:24,024 --> 00:02:27,159
Only one little snowflake left!

65
00:02:27,409 --> 00:02:29,745
Can you point to it?

66
00:02:33,045 --> 00:02:34,661
One little snowflake,

67
00:02:34,661 --> 00:02:36,141
dancing in the sky.

68
00:02:36,441 --> 00:02:37,969
It's flying to YOU!

69
00:02:37,969 --> 00:02:39,288
Touch your nose!

70
00:02:41,288 --> 00:02:41,888
Drip! Bye bye!

71
00:02:42,188 --> 00:02:44,957
How many snowflakes now?

72
00:02:46,957 --> 00:02:49,688
Zero! I didn't keep a single one!

73
00:02:51,538 --> 00:02:53,287
Don't worry, Pip!

74
00:02:53,287 --> 00:02:54,249
Look up!

75
00:02:54,499 --> 00:02:57,095
More snow is coming!

76
00:02:57,645 --> 00:03:00,530
Here are two new snowflakes.

77
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:03,184
Which one is big?

78
00:03:05,184 --> 00:03:06,044
That one!

79
00:03:06,044 --> 00:03:07,549
The big snowflake!

80
00:03:07,799 --> 00:03:09,684
And this one is small.

81
00:03:11,534 --> 00:03:13,155
Watch my wings!

82
00:03:13,155 --> 00:03:14,957
Flap, flap, flap!

83
00:03:17,207 --> 00:03:21,283
Whoosh! Are the snowflakes going fast, or slow?

84
00:03:23,283 --> 00:03:25,514
Fast! Swirly and fast!

85
00:03:26,064 --> 00:03:28,954
Now they float down slowly.

86
00:03:29,204 --> 00:03:32,216
Can you float down slowly too?

87
00:03:36,816 --> 00:03:37,876
Pip, look!

88
00:03:37,876 --> 00:03:40,484
A snowflake on my red mitten.

89
00:03:40,734 --> 00:03:43,213
And it's not melting!

90
00:03:43,763 --> 00:03:44,504
Why not?

91
00:03:44,504 --> 00:03:46,186
Why didn't it go drip?

92
00:03:48,186 --> 00:03:50,213
Lulu's mitten is cold,

93
00:03:50,213 --> 00:03:51,590
like the snow!

94
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:54,026
Cold keeps snowflakes.

95
00:03:54,026 --> 00:03:55,686
Warm melts them!

96
00:03:57,536 --> 00:04:00,998
Mama, I wanted to keep a snowflake for ever.

97
00:04:01,248 --> 00:04:03,344
But they always melt.

98
00:04:03,894 --> 00:04:06,734
Snowflakes don't stay, Pip.

99
00:04:06,984 --> 00:04:10,552
But the whole garden is full of them, to share!

100
00:04:11,102 --> 00:04:12,633
Then let's say hello,

101
00:04:12,633 --> 00:04:13,909
and let them fly!

102
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:16,294
Wave hello to the snow!

103
00:04:19,594 --> 00:04:22,825
Let's sing the Five Little Snowflakes Song!

104
00:04:23,075 --> 00:04:25,267
Make snowflake fingers!

105
00:04:26,267 --> 00:04:27,883
Snowflakes falling,

106
00:04:27,883 --> 00:04:29,132
soft and slow!

107
00:04:29,432 --> 00:04:31,212
Twirling, swirling,

108
00:04:31,212 --> 00:04:32,506
down they go!

109
00:04:33,006 --> 00:04:35,048
Five little snowflakes,

110
00:04:35,048 --> 00:04:36,775
dancing in the sky,

111
00:04:37,075 --> 00:04:40,152
One fell on a warm, warm nose.

112
00:04:40,402 --> 00:04:41,768
Drip! Bye bye!

113
00:04:43,668 --> 00:04:44,694
Four, three,

114
00:04:44,694 --> 00:04:46,404
two little snowflakes,

115
00:04:46,404 --> 00:04:47,909
dancing in the sky,

116
00:04:48,209 --> 00:04:50,244
Melting on our noses!

117
00:04:50,244 --> 00:04:51,940
Drip, drip, drip!

118
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:53,940
Bye bye!

119
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:57,694
One little snowflake landed on a mitten,

120
00:04:57,994 --> 00:04:59,336
Cold and cosy,

121
00:04:59,336 --> 00:05:01,703
like a little white kitten!

122
00:05:03,803 --> 00:05:04,872
Twirl around!

123
00:05:04,872 --> 00:05:06,341
Snowflakes falling,

124
00:05:06,341 --> 00:05:07,476
soft and slow!

125
00:05:07,726 --> 00:05:09,251
Twirling, swirling,

126
00:05:09,251 --> 00:05:10,361
down they go!

127
00:05:11,161 --> 00:05:15,029
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

128
00:05:15,629 --> 00:05:16,508
Next time,

129
00:05:16,508 --> 00:05:19,685
Pip Puppy and Dotty find shapes in the snow!

130
00:05:20,285 --> 00:05:21,808
Woof! Bye bye, friends!

131
00:05:21,808 --> 00:05:24,208
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
